</TABLE><font size="1">Click on Event for Detail</font><H3>Event Detail</H3><TABLE width="100%"><TR><TD width="100"><B>Title</B></TD><TD width="100%">Hole/Kirn</TD></TR><TR><TD><B>Category</B></TD><TD>GUILDRAID</TD></TR><TR><TD valign="top"><B>Description</B></TD><TD>Well, after doing quite a bit of research I pretty much came to the same conclusion that I had expected....This is going to take a lot of firepower.  I've posted on the Calendar for Friday May 11, 7 pm PST to do this and am basically  looking for assistance from some fairly high level and experienced people.  Not sure of the level restriction on this yet until I've spoken to a few more people, but will prolley be either 50+ or 53+.  Although this raid doesn't apply to many of you, I'd encourage those of you that ARE 50+ to please sign up at: <A HREF="http://pub4.ezboard.com/feqasylumfrm25.showMessage?topicID=898.topic" TARGET=_blank>http://pub4.ezboard.com/feqasylumfrm25.showMessage?topicID=898.topic</A> <P>On a side note...I DO plan on holding a Bears raid to the Hole soon.  Still trying to get an idea of how far we can go at our current levels and want to get a halfling rogue alt in there for scouting purposes and CR if need be.<P>Brask</TD></TR><TR><TD><B>Start</B></TD><TD>2001-05-11 19:00:00-07</TD></TR><TR><TD><B>Duration</B></TD><TD>3 hour(s)</TD></TR><TR><TD><B>InfoLink</B></TD><TD><A HREF="http://oboo.cybrick.com/ubb/Forum10/HTML/000046.html">Hole/Kirn raid for Lelleasha's Epic</A></TD></TR></TABLE><BR>
